{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a world of magic and perilous adventures in Tale of Dark Lands \u2013 a fantasy Action RPG with a low-poly style and the atmosphere of a charming fairy tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version introduces you to the beginning of an exciting story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a brave mercenary hired by the inhabitants of a small village to protect them from fierce goblins. But a simple job quickly turns into an adventure full of mysteries and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create and develop your hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The character editor allows you to customize your hero\u2019s appearance, while the progression system lets you develop their skills, earn experience, and grow stronger with every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version includes the introduction and the first two missions, giving you a taste of the Tale of Dark Lands world and preparing you for a grand adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to embark on your first journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579530?t=1743175148","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579530/a120c477acb6d9eaf07e268cb15c6c753897c212/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743175148","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579530/9901ea61941851d85cf18364a40e2167e86be518/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743175148","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579530/9901ea61941851d85cf18364a40e2167e86be518/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743175148","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a world of magic and perilous adventures in Tale of Dark Lands \u2013 a fantasy Action RPG with a low-poly style and the atmosphere of a charming fairy tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version introduces you to the beginning of an exciting story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a brave mercenary hired by the inhabitants of a small village to protect them from fierce goblins. But a simple job quickly turns into an adventure full of mysteries and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create and develop your hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The character editor allows you to customize your hero\u2019s appearance, while the progression system lets you develop their skills, earn experience, and grow stronger with every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version includes the introduction and the first two missions, giving you a taste of the Tale of Dark Lands world and preparing you for a grand adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to embark on your first journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Satur Entertainment"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3475860","name":"Tale of Dark Lands"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579530/882bd3a11c7e8de5946c874f2f33af7c21575dd3/header.jpg?t=1743175148","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br